  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Devt. WGCF - Project mang.&amp; follow-up</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Institutional Devt. WGCF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A continuation of a series of similar projects. This is a consolidation phase in which Sida conlcludes its three decades of support to the Wondo Genet College of Forestry. The main purpose of the project is to enable Wondo Genet fill its gaps in terms of human and material resources and ensure its capacity to run the MSC Forestry training programme by its own.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En forts&#xE4;ttning p&#xE5; en rad liknande projekt. Detta &#xE4;r en konsolideringsfas d&#xE4;r Sida conlcludes sina tre decennier av st&#xF6;d till Wondo Genet College of Forestry. Huvudsyftet med projektet &#xE4;r att g&#xF6;ra det m&#xF6;jligt f&#xF6;r Wondo Genet fylla sina brister n&#xE4;r det g&#xE4;ller m&#xE4;nskliga och materiella resurser och s&#xE4;kerst&#xE4;lla dess kapacitet att k&#xF6;ra MSC Skogs utbildningen av sin egen.</narrative>
  </description>
